description":"JEE Main's 2020 JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Morning Slot Paper's All Questions with solutions provider ExamSIDE.Com","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Morning Slot","nextq":"eOSqxQ3fk1N3k8MNARjgy2xukeuuwq8h","prevq":"SDTw5rZDxIKzcesy2fjgy2xukeuurjeu","questions":[{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"physics","chapterGroup":"mechanics","chapter":"units-and-measurements","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Morning Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"medium","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-02 09:00","question":{"en":{"content":"The least count of the main scale of a vernier\ncallipers is 1 mm. Its vernier scale is divided\ninto 10 divisions and coincide with 9 divisions\nof the main scale. When jaws are touching\neach other, the 7<sup>th</sup> division of vernier scale\ncoincides with a division of main scale and the\nzero of vernier scale is lying right side of the\nzero of main scale. When this vernier is used to\nmeasure length of a cylinder the zero of the\nvernier scale between 3.1 cm and 3.2 cm and\n4<sup>th</sup> VSD coincides with a main scale division.\nThe length of the cylinder is : (VSD is vernier\nscale division)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"3.21 cm"},{"identifier":"B","content":"2.99 cm"},{"identifier":"C","content":"3.07 cm"},{"identifier":"D","content":"3.2 cm"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"Least count = 1 mm or 0.01 cm\n<br><br>Zero error = 0 + 0.01 × 7 = 0.07 cm\n<br><br>Reading = 3.1 + (0.01 × 4) – 0.07\n<br><br>= 3.1 + 0.04 – 0.07\n\n<br><br>= 3.1 – 0.03\n\n<br><br>= 3.07 cm"},"hi":{"content":"एक वर्नियर कैलीपर्स के मुख्य पैमाने का न्यूनतम माप 1 मिमी है। इसका वर्नियर पैमाना 10 भागों में विभाजित है और मुख्य पैमाने के 9 भागों के साथ मेल खाता है। जब जॉ एक-दूसरे को छू रहे होते हैं, तब वर्नियर पैमाने का 7वां भाग मुख्य पैमाने के एक भाग के साथ मेल खाता है और वर्नियर पैमाने का शून्य मुख्य पैमाने के शून्य के दाहिने तरफ स्थित है। जब इस वर्नियर का उपयोग करके एक सिलेंडर की लंबाई मापी जाती है तो वर्नियर पैमाने का शून्य 3.1 सेमी और 3.2 सेमी के बीच में होता है और 4वां VSD मुख्य पैमाने के एक भाग के साथ मेल खाता है। सिलेंडर की लंबाई है: (VSD वर्नियर पैमाने का भाग है)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"3.21 सेमी"},{"identifier":"B","content":"2.99 सेमी"},{"identifier":"C","content":"3.07 सेमी"},{"identifier":"D","content":"3.2 सेमी"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"LsWAOacRx13cxoyErzjgy2xukev16eea","updated_time":null,"permalink":"the-least-count-of-the-main-scale-of-a-vernier-callipers-is-jee-main-physics-units-and-measurements-r0wvccjlwepit4ap","topic":"vernier-calipers","paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-2nd-september-morning-slot","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-2nd-september-morning-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"physics","chapterGroup":"mechanics","chapter":"units-and-measurements","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 2nd September Morning Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en","hi"],"difficulty":"medium","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-02 09:00","question":{"en":{"content":"If speed V, area A and force F are chosen as\nfundamental units, then the dimension of\nYoung’s modulus will be","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"FA<sup>–1</sup>V<sup>0</sup>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"FA<sup>2</sup>V<sup>–1</sup>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"FA<sup>2</sup>V<sup>–2</sup>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"FA<sup>2</sup>V<sup>–3</sup>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"Y = k [F]<sup>x</sup>\n [A]<sup>y</sup>\n [V]<sup>z</sup>\n<br><br>[M<sup>1</sup>L<sup>1</sup>T\n<sup>–2</sup>] = [MLT<sup>–2</sup>]<sup>x</sup> [L<sup>2</sup>]<sup>y